WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.501
The fictional draft contains a prohibited sensitive detail.

00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:07.877
The service reviewer stops the practice under the supplied rule.

00:00:07.877 --> 00:00:11.378
Do not simply delete the sentence and continue.

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:15.316
The coordinator records the trigger without spreading the detail.

00:00:15.316 --> 00:00:19.254
The policy owner handles the information and permission concern.

00:00:19.254 --> 00:00:27.131
The reviewer can correct or reject the draft; restart requires the appropriate human decision under the actual policy.

00:00:27.131 --> 00:00:29.757
Rehearse this route using invented information.

00:00:29.757 --> 00:00:37.634
In your project, name the stopping role, action paused, safe evidence record and restart authority without inventing procedures.

00:00:37.634 --> 00:00:43.760
Save the adoption plan and pilot test design with measures, dependencies and review event.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:49.887
Identify who approves, stops and corrects, and explain why productivity alone cannot justify expansion.

00:00:49.887 --> 00:00:53.825
Preserve the associated workbook section and earlier project work.

00:00:53.825 --> 00:00:58.201
A saved design is not evidence that a pilot occurred.
